      "sourceHash": "2776a93831a938bd",
      "translationZh": "（英语不是我的母语，如有措辞不自然的地方，还请见谅。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "717a127005291977",
      "translationZh": "在本地用一张 8GB RTX 5060 Ti 训练小模型时，每当运行过程中内存占用骤增，就会随机出现 CUDA OOM 崩溃，简直快把我逼疯了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7c99479c397ec7c",
      "translationZh": "我不想再用保守的批次大小、手动盯着训练运行，于是围绕 PyTorch 构建了一个轻量级 Python 调控器，名为 MEM Orchestrator：https://github.com/nobazzy/mem-llm-orchestrator",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0baa72bd04829d1d",
      "translationZh": "监控训练期间的显存余量。动态调节微批次大小和梯度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f37ebd004af4f6ce",
      "translationZh": "累积，以避免触发 OOM。逐步",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d8374f6858607c0a",
      "translationZh": "在内存压力下降时重新调高。以原子方式保存检查点，并使用 SHA-256 校验，确保崩溃绝不会损坏权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ca2f80c211ff2905",
      "translationZh": "main : 集成 DeepSpeed ZeRO 的 Linux 核心。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d810e14b9a5c9a9e",
      "translationZh": "refactor/architecture-and-portability : 解耦的原生 PyTorch 运行器，可跨平台运行（已在 Windows 上测试）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a63846c0ead7185",
      "translationZh": "我在一个 130M 模型上进行了 1M 步的耐久测试，并通过注入内存用量突增，对一个 255M 模型进行了压力测试，均未发生崩溃。额外开销低于 0.5%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99211dbc3609cbba",
      "translationZh": "代码和 38 个单元测试已放在 GitHub 上。我非常希望有 PyTorch 内存分配器或 DeepSpeed 使用经验的人提供反馈，谈谈这种方法是否合理，或者会在哪些情况下失效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
